      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salton_Sea_Beach%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During its heyday, boaters and families gathered along Salton Sea Beach for fishing, boating, and camping, making it a lively oasis.",
